    2.22: z3 @1,0
    2.29: cut " ∀a. ∀b. ∀c. ∀d. ∀r. ∀t. a / b * r * (c / d * t) ≤ 0 ⟷ 0 ≤ -1 ^ (1::nat) * a * c * (r * t) / b / d"
    2.29: introduction a,b,c,d,r,t
